  unitName: Water Totem
  unitId: 20133
  unitNumber: 190
  description: Created by the gods, it embodies the power of water. Referred to as
    a great disaster in ancient writings, it appeared along with the wrath of the
    gods, bringing floods along with it. There are a few reports of it in Grand Gaia.
    Torrential rains always fall around its massive body. Legend says that only those
    Summoners recognized by the gods can defeat it.
  summonDesc: I am a Water Totem.<br>You would be wise to correctly use<br>power
    sealed by the gods.
